WEBVTT

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.800
Eight minutes and twenty from your face to mine

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:17.020
everything I see of you is running behind

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:21.220
sprinklers on the driveway and the radio on

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:25.060
all of this light left before you were gone

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:29.460
We've been falling since the day we met

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:34.800
round and round and never landing yet

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:38.800
You went dark

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:44.040
but you didn't let go

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:47.860
all I see is your ghost

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:55.880
and I'm still falling for you

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:59.780
The far galaxies leave, going red as they go

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:03.100
the whole sky was burning once, now it barely glows

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:06.280
some of the snow on the TV is that light

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:09.940
thirteen point eight billion years of goodbye

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:13.420
We asked the dark, where is everybody?

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:17.280
one night in Ohio a signal, then Wow

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:20.100
and the sky never said it again

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:23.400
You went dark

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:28.470
but you didn't let go

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:32.320
all I see is your ghost

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:41.220
and I'm still falling for you

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:44.020
Fall in slow

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:47.320
from out here you never go

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:51.420
you just stop at the edge and turn red

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:55.860
everything you were is written on the edge

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:59.240
nothing gets lost, we think

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:01.800
You went dark

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:03.740
but you didn't let go

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:07.720
all I see is your ghost

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:08.820
you went

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:11.760
DARK!

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:17.580
you didn't let go
